he declared physical phenomenon. d.3 Confirmation Physical Phenomenon in the affected installation: This installation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon during the last 24 mobile months. Confirmation Physical phenomena in facilities of the same owner: Three faults have occurred in facilities of the same owner with the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 months, corresponding to the Studies for Failure Analysis of the following table: Date_FALL FALLA NAME_FALLA ACTIONS_CORRECTIVES To the","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 350/2025\n\u201cDesconexi\u00f3n forzada de barra 15 kV N\u00b02 de S/E Colchagua\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 25-08-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 01/08/2025\nHora 03:33\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 6.90\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 8538.00\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.081 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n Barra N\u00b02 de 15 kV de S/E Colchagua / BA03T0058SE041T0058.\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Subestaci\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66/15 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstides Quezada Escobar.\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, Oficina 1701, piso 17, Las Condes.\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento fallado Pararrayos del pa\u00f1o C5 de S/E Colchagua / PA011T0058SE041T0058 (*)\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Ar\u00edstides Quezada Escobar.\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco 5561, Oficina 1701, piso 17, Las Condes.\n(*) Nemot\u00e9cnico corresponde al pa\u00f1o C5 de S/E Colchagua.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la desconexi\u00f3n forzada de la barra N\u00b02 de 15 kV de S/E Colchagua y del alimentador\nMaggi (52C7), ante una falla ocurrida en el pararrayos del pa\u00f1o C5, cuya causa fue una descarga\natmosf\u00e9rica, la cual provoc\u00f3 un flashover que alcanz\u00f3 la mencionada barra.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nCLI3: Descargas el\u00e9ctricas atmosf\u00e9ricas.\nLa empresa CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A. entrega antecedentes probatorios para acreditar el fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico\ndeclarado.\nd.3 Reiteraci\u00f3n\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico en la instalaci\u00f3n afectada: Esta instalaci\u00f3n no ha sido afectada por el\nmismo fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico du","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":-0.01},{"w":"fault","s":-0.08},{"w":"2025","s":-0.06},{"w":"forced","s":0.21},{"w":"bar","s":1.0},{"w":"15","s":0.12},{"w":"kv","s":0.04},{"w":"date","s":0.01},{"w":"description","s":-0.04},{"w":"date","s":0.01},{"w":"time","s":0.02},{"w":"failure","s":-0.12},{"w":"date","s":0.01},{"w":"01","s":0.06},{"w":"08","s":0.15},{"w":"2025","s":-0.06},{"w":"time","s":0.02},{"w":"03","s":0.04},{"w":"consumptions","s":0.12},{"w":"mw","s":0.07},{"w":"mw","s":0.07},{"w":"00","s":-0.1},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.02},{"w":"does","s":-0.05}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"busbar_fault","display_pred":"OVERHEATING/OVERLOAD","probs":{"line_fault":0.0328,"breaker_fault":0.1287,"transformer_fault":0.0693,"busbar_fault":0.7692},"confidence":0.7692,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"busbar_fault","display_pred":"OVERHEATING/OVERLOAD","probs":{"line_fault":0.0872,"breaker_fault":0.2695,"transformer_fault":0.1402,"busbar_fault":0.5031},"confidence":0.5031,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"OPEN CIRCUIT","probs":{"line_fault":0.1277,"breaker_fault":0.4037,"transformer_fault":0.1273,"busbar_fault":0.3413},"confidence":0.4037,"correct":false}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modality)","contrib":{"D":{"share":0.2529,"signed":0